sion registry; redacted renderings throughout.\n56|- internal/config: Version4/TransportSSHTLS13/HostChannelVersion constants;\n57|  closed rawV4 reader (required transport, no default; required closed\n58|  host_channel; no per-peer override; no cert bytes possible by shape);\n59|  v4 validation; EncodeVersion4 (defence-in-depth re-read); EncodeCurrent\n60|  refuses v4 values; Migrate→v4 refuses toward Preview/Apply;\n61|  Migrate v4→v3 refuses as downgrade; AssessCompatibility v4/v4 compatible,\n62|  v3-reader read-only; PreviewV4 (v3-only source, admitted credential,\n63|  complete peer enrollment or named drops, exact bytes); ApplyV4 (confirm,\n64|  source/gen/bytes/custody re-validation, backup, generation-bump commit\n65|  with config recovery); RollbackV4 (ack, backup-only, generation bump,\n66|  idempotent no-op).\n67|- interop: v4 snapshots flow through peeridentity.FromSnapshot unchanged\n68|  (internal/peeridentity/v4_interop_test.go).\n69|- census: secprim roster extended to hosttrust package + 5 disposition rows\n70|  (40 sites); redaction/error-identity discipline preserved.\n71|\n72|## AC coverage: 21 of 21 rows driven through production entry points\n73|\n74|Reader: config.Decode (schema_v4 tests), hosttrust.DecodeTrust (trust tests).\n75|Refusals missing/partial/unreadable/ambiguous/downgraded: store + preview +\n76|apply + rollback absent/corrupt/dup/legacy cases. No legacy fallback:\n77|required transport, Migrate-v4-explicit, EncodeCurrent-v4 refusal, v3-reader\n78|read-only. Enrollment/mapping/rotation/revocation/generation-auth: lifecycle\n79|+ authorize tests. Owner-only atomic crash-durable writes: custody tests incl.\n80|fault-seam commit failure, staging discipline, trust-commit recovery.\n81|Exact-preview migration + peer enrollment + durable apply/rollback: preview,\n82|apply, rollback tests. Preservation: full existing suites green unmodified +\n83|interop test. Platform/crash evidence: darwin 0700/0600/owner/symlink/fault\n84|tests (thi