never repairs them:\n117|  silently narrowing a widened directory would mask the violation (found by\n118|  TestCustodyRefusals).\n119|- Secret-census blind spot (honest): LeafKeyDER and \"private-key.pem\" evade\n120|  the token list (\"key\" alone is not a token; hyphen vs underscore). Not\n121|  widening the token list here (would re-derive the whole repo); covered by\n122|  TestNoSecretReplication + redaction tests instead.\n123|- Untracked candidates for review: internal/hosttrust/*,\n124|  internal/config/migration_v4*.go + schema_v4_test.go +\n125|  migration_v4_test.go + migration_v4_apply_test.go + mutations_v4.py,\n126|  internal/peeridentity/v4_interop_test.go. Tracked edits: config migration/\n127|  schema/validation/writer, refusal pin, secprim census rows.","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"read_file","outcome":"success"}}}
