{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000dc2b","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a08929-2295-79c3-b516-94fb67387c85"},"sequence":3184,"recorded_at":1780531400006363,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"d85af3b0-d1fc-4877-88c4-7da3d8622a21","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"d85af3b0-d1fc-4877-88c4-7da3d8622a21","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"d85af3b0-d1fc-4877-88c4-7da3d8622a21"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0893b-632c-7261-8bde-e7626c86d5bd"},"task_id":"01a0893b-632c-7261-8bde-e7626c86d5bd","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0893b-632c-7261-8bde-e7626c86d5bd","chunk":"{\n  \"chunk_id\": \"exec-107-1\",\n  \"command\": \"python3 - <<'EOF'\\np = 'LOGBOOK.md'\\nlines = open(p).readlines()\\nentry = '''## 2026-09-10 (refresh)\\n\\n### TASK-260909-2ez769 refresh — story base moved c1eff01 to a89328c (trunk 8cf4aaa + v0.6.0 adoption)\\n- REFRESH: `task-board worktree refresh-candidate` with exclusive lease (RUN-260910-a4ac2c). Round 1 (43c0e2b peer-identity): 5 file resolutions — LOGBOOK merged newest-first, README trunk + peer tail, 3 traceability files trunk-wins (v0.6.0 registry pin authoritative; v0.5.0 digest superseded). Round 2 (c1eff01 SSH): 4 resolutions reusing round-1 bytes + README with SSH `## SSH stdio transport` section appended and peer-section wording. Packet schema learned from tool errors: entries {checkpoint_oid, path, sha256, content-base64}. Both replayed commits signed oparin@me.com (41106b6, a89328c, verify-commit Good).\\n- COMBINE: worktree restored to candidate snapshot by tool; 30 enumerated incoming paths restored from HEAD (8 adoption files incl. SPEC.v0.6.0.md, v0.6.0.lock.json, ownership.v0.6.0.json, task-board.config.json v0.6.0 cataloggen command); 6 tracked candidate files untouched by adoption kept; LOGBOOK re-merged (HEAD + 2 prior credential entries). Candidate bytes verified 40/40 match pre-refresh