mpatibility_regression_test.go` const Version4 removed (production wins, same value); v4 lanes now positive per-lane loads (windows/ax.conpty, wsl2/ax.tmux, native plugdirs); conpty-on-v4 now closed-shape refusal (ErrConfigDecode, never version refusal). `schema_test.go` v4 branch now bare-doc required-member refusal + complete-doc positive (SourceVersion 4.0.0, ssh_tls13, host_channel); \\\"unsupported major\\\" renamed. `migration_test.go` assessor now 6 read-only / 10 compatible / 0 refused (was 6/6/4). `migration_refusal_test.go` v4 row now wants ErrMigrationV4Explicit (explicit-preview gate pinned through adoption test).\\n- VALIDATION (head a89328c): gofmt clean; go vet ./... clean; GOOS=windows build hosttrust+config ok; go build ./... ok; go test ./... -count=1 26/26 ok; -cover config 93.2 hosttrust 77.0 peeridentity 97.5 secprim 94.4; tracecheck ok (63/36/101/32, clauses 17/463); catalog v0.6.0 -check ok (former gate-21 input present). Mutation batteries rerun on new base: hosttrust 15 narrowing killed + neutral passed; config 4 narrowing killed + neutral passed; manifests bound to a89328c in mutations-hosttrust-refresh/ and mutations-config-refresh/.\\n- PRESERVATION: RPC backup 15/15 manifest match; parked 11/11 match; tracked RPC paths clean; no rpcwire/UNRESOLVED remnants; RPC delta absent from candidate. Worktree left UNCOMMITTED for snapshot; no main push/integration (orchestrator step).\\n\\n'''\\nassert lines[5].startswith('## 2026-09-10 (later)')\\nopen(p, 'w').write(''.join(lines[:5]) + entry + ''.join(lines[5:]))\\nprint('logbook updated')\\nEOF\\ngofmt -l internal/; echo FMT-OK\",\n  \"description\": \"Append logbook entry for refresh run\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"logbook updated\\nFMT-OK\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 23,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 6,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"bash","outcome":"success"}}}
